        {
            "id": "bunkerbots",
            "name": "Bunkerbots x Vastina Collab!",
            "synopsis": "Joe takes Vastina on a tour through his bunker. She & the Bunkerbots screw around, & there's yuri...",
            "directory": "twitter/3_bunkerbots/",
            "theme": "3d",
            "panels": [
                {
                    "from": "Vastina",
                    "text": "Well... I Think This Is The Address.",
                    "file": ["1.png"],
                    "source": "https://x.com/VistaWidgets/status/2056719357380620498",
                    "unix": 1779195081,
                    "extra": [
                        {
                            "type": "transcript",
                            "name": "Transcript of Note",
                            "content": "\"Dear Pesky Plumbers, The Koopalings and I have taken over the Mushroom Kingdom. The princess is now a permanent guest at one of my 7 Koopa Hotels. I dare you to find her if you can!\""
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "from": "Vastina",
                    "text": "*Knock Knock Knock* Anyone Home?",
                    "file": ["2.png"],
                    "source": "https://x.com/VistaWidgets/status/2056719357380620498",
                    "unix": 1779195105
                },
                {
                    "from": "Joe",
                    "text": "\u00F0\u009F\u009F\u00A7: oh hey it's Vastina",
                    "file": [],
                    "source": "https://x.com/joetherobo52693/status/2056719970298474693",
                    "unix": 1779195227
                },
                {
                    "from": "Vastina",
                    "text": "Hey, Joe! Mind If I Come In? Thought I Would Give You Guys A Visit! :D",
                    "file": [],
                    "source": "https://x.com/VistaWidgets/status/2056720161109901498",
                    "unix": 1779195273
                },
                {
                    "from": "Joe",
                    "text": "\u00F0\u009F\u009F\u00A7: sure, just take the elevator down",
                    "file": [],
                    "source": "https://x.com/joetherobo52693/status/2056720450349093193",
                    "unix": 1779195342
                },
                {
                    "from": "Vastina",
                    "text": "*Humming*",
                    "file": [],
                    "source": "https://x.com/VistaWidgets/status/2056737853829169455",
                    "unix": 1779199491
                },
                {
                    "from": "Joe",
                    "text": "\u00F0\u009F\u009F\u00A7: hmmmm",
                    "file": [],
                    "source": "https://x.com/joetherobo52693/status/2056738731332145200",
                    "unix": 1779199700
                },
                {
                    "from": "Joe",
                    "text": "\u00F0\u009F\u009F\u00A7: so this is the dining room\nwe don't do much dining in here though\nbut it's here",
                    "file": ["3.png"],
                    "source": "https://x.com/joetherobo52693/status/2056764565619097817",
                    "unix": 1779205859
                },
                {
                    "from": "Vastina",
                    "text": "Oh! This Room Looks Pretty! But... Where Are The Chairs?",
                    "file": [],
                    "source": "https://x.com/VistaWidgets/status/2056764783697772891",
                    "unix": 1779205911
                },
                {
                    "from": "Joe",
                    "text": "\u00F0\u009F\u009F\u00A7: honest to god i have no clue",
                    "file": ["4.png"],
                    "source": "https://x.com/joetherobo52693/status/2056766868334002569",
                    "unix": 1779206408
                },
                {
                    "from": "Vastina",
                    "text": "A Dinning Room Without Chairs? What Kind Of Nonsense Is That!? D:",
                    "file": ["5.png"],
                    "source": "https://x.com/VistaWidgets/status/2056777926591307999",
                    "unix": 1779209045
                },
                {
                    "from": "Joe",
                    "text": "\u00F0\u009F\u009F\u00A7: complete nonsense i say",
                    "file": ["6.png"],
                    "source": "https://x.com/joetherobo52693/status/2056780940957937821",
                    "unix": 1779209764
                },
                {
                    "from": "Vastina",
                    "text": "You Guys Should Buy Some Chairs Then!",
                    "file": [],
                    "source": "https://x.com/VistaWidgets/status/2056782621724586141",
                    "unix": 1779210164
                },
                {
                    "from": "Joe",
                    "text": "\u00F0\u009F\u009F\u00A7: i only had enough for one stool",
                    "file": [],
                    "source": "https://x.com/joetherobo52693/status/2056782741555880159",
                    "unix": 1779210193
                },
                {
                    "from": "Vastina",
                    "text": "I'm Gonna Murder You.",
                    "file": [],
                    "source": "https://x.com/VistaWidgets/status/2056784008210464803",
                    "unix": 1779210495
                },
                {
                    "from": "Joe",
                    "text": "\u00F0\u009F\u009F\u00A7: :(",
                    "file": [],
                    "source": "https://x.com/joetherobo52693/status/2056784587863269710",
                    "unix": 1779210633
                },
                {
                    "from": "Vastina",
                    "text": "Look I Got Some Spare Cash You Can Buy A Couple Chairs With This, Okay?\n[You Got 1,000 Dollars!]",
                    "file": ["chest-zelda.gif"],
                    "source": "https://x.com/VistaWidgets/status/2056786558288609359",
                    "unix": 1779211103
                },
                {
                    "from": "Joe",
                    "text": "\u00F0\u009F\u009F\u00A7: oh sweet\nthanks",
                    "file": [],
                    "source": "https://x.com/joetherobo52693/status/2056787487813505301",
                    "unix": 1779211325
                },
                {
                    "from": "Vastina",
                    "text": "No Problem!!!",
                    "file": [],
                    "source": "https://x.com/VistaWidgets/status/2056790707248021538",
                    "unix": 1779212092
                },
                {
                    "from": "Joe",
                    "text": ": anyways\nlets continue this tour",
                    "file": [],
                    "source": "https://x.com/joetherobo52693/status/2056790850835747220",
                    "unix": 1779212126
                },
                {
                    "from": "Vastina",
                    "text": "Yes, Yes! Where Too Next? :O",
                    "file": [],
                    "source": "https://x.com/VistaWidgets/status/2056790938849075480",
                    "unix": 1779212147
                },
                {
                    "from": "Joe",
                    "text": "\u00F0\u009F\u009F\u00A7: what about my room?\nWaltz and Vivian are in there if you'd like to talk to them",
                    "file": ["7.png"],
                    "source": "https://x.com/joetherobo52693/status/2056792937732739322",
                    "unix": 1779212624
                },
                {
                    "from": "Vastina",
                    "text": "Yeah, Sure!",
                    "file": [],
                    "source": "https://x.com/VistaWidgets/status/2056794064217850337",
                    "unix": 1779212892
                },
                {
                    "from": "Joe",
                    "text": "\u00F0\u009F\u009F\u00A7: alrighty than\nhere it is!",
                    "file": ["8.png"],
                    "source": "https://x.com/joetherobo52693/status/2056800102677639673",
                    "unix": 1779214332
                },
                {
                    "from": "Vastina",
                    "text": "Hey Guys-",
                    "file": ["9.png"],
                    "source": "https://x.com/VistaWidgets/status/2056800224979349829",
                    "unix": 1779214361
                },
                {
                    "from": "Vastina",
                    "text": "Woah... Who Is That Fine Lady Over There? 👀",
                    "file": ["10.png"],
                    "source": "https://x.com/VistaWidgets/status/2056800333322481738",
                    "unix": 1779214387
                },
                {
                    "from": "Vivian",
                    "text": "\u00F0\u009F\u0092\u009C: uh\n\nheyyyy Vastina",
                    "file": ["11.png", "12.png"],
                    "source": "https://x.com/joetherobo52693/status/2056804286902780290",
                    "unix": 1779215330
                },
                {
                    "from": "Vastina",
                    "text": "Hey Vivian! You're Lookin' Good! :D",
                    "file": [],
                    "source": "https://x.com/VistaWidgets/status/2056800333322481738",
                    "unix": 1779215382
                },
                {
                    "from": "Vivian",
                    "text": "\u00F0\u009F\u0092\u009C: yeahh\nyou too",
                    "file": [],
                    "source": "https://x.com/joetherobo52693/status/2056805002409037832",
                    "unix": 1779215500
                },
                {
                    "from": "Vastina",
                    "text": "Yeahh- Woah Waltz.. What Happened To You?",
                    "file": [],
                    "source": "https://x.com/VistaWidgets/status/2056805431708680385",
                    "unix": 1779215603
                },
                {
                    "from": "Waltz",
                    "text": "\u00F0\u009F\u009F\u00A2: I PUT GLUE ON MY WHEEL TO RIDE ON THE WALLS\nI GOT STUCK",
                    "file": [],
                    "source": "https://x.com/joetherobo52693/status/2056806791116157187",
                    "unix": 1779215927
                },
                {
                    "from": "Vastina",
                    "text": "Here- *Grunt* Let Me Get You Down- *Grunt*",
                    "file": ["15.png"],
                    "source": "https://x.com/VistaWidgets/status/2056816042521849993",
                    "unix": 1779218132
                },
                {
                    "from": "Waltz",
                    "text": "\u00F0\u009F\u009F\u00A2: WAIT WAIT\nI CAN GET DOWN MYSELF",
                    "file": [],
                    "source": "https://x.com/joetherobo52693/status/2056816185207914673",
                    "unix": 1779218167
                },
                {
                    "from": "Vastina",
                    "text": "Then Why Are You- Even- Up Here???",
                    "file": [],
                    "source": "https://x.com/VistaWidgets/status/2056816429295349869",
                    "unix": 1779218225
                },
                {
                    "from": "Waltz",
                    "text": "\u00F0\u009F\u009F\u00A2: I AM CURRENTLY FIGURING OUT METHODS OF ESCAPE",
                    "file": [],
                    "source": "https://x.com/joetherobo52693/status/2056816582739833247",
                    "unix": 1779218261
                },
                {
                    "from": "Vastina",
                    "text": "W-Why Not Just- Take Off Your Wheel-? Screw It Off Or Something!",
                    "file": [],
                    "source": "https://x.com/VistaWidgets/status/2056819696784089588",
                    "unix": 1779219004
                },
                {
                    "from": "Waltz",
                    "text": "\u00F0\u009F\u009F\u00A2: WOW\nWHY DIDN'T I THINK OF THAT",
                    "file": [],
                    "source": "https://x.com/joetherobo52693/status/2056819942024958222",
                    "unix": 1779219062
                },
                {
                    "from": "Vastina",
                    "text": "Dude",
                    "file": [],
                    "source": "https://x.com/VistaWidgets/status/2056822203870494829",
                    "unix": 1779219601
                },
                {
                    "from": "Waltz",
                    "text": "\u00F0\u009F\u009F\u00A2: I WILL LOOK INTO IT SOON",
                    "file": [],
                    "source": "https://x.com/joetherobo52693/status/2056822688501453080",
                    "unix": 1779219707
                },
                {
                    "from": "Vastina",
                    "text": "Hold On, Maybe I Can Find Something To Help!",
                    "file": [],
                    "source": "https://x.com/VistaWidgets/status/2056872759985127442",
                    "unix": 1779231655
                },
                {
                    "from": "Joe",
                    "text": "\u00F0\u009F\u009F\u00A7: hey wait up!",
                    "file": ["16.png"],
                    "source": "https://x.com/joetherobo52693/status/2056873870070608122",
                    "unix": 1779231920
                },
                {
                    "from": "Vastina",
                    "text": "What Is It?",
                    "file": ["17.png"],
                    "source": "https://x.com/VistaWidgets/status/2056874445977813491",
                    "unix": 1779232057
                },
                {
                    "from": "Joe",
                    "text": "\u00F0\u009F\u009F\u00A7: i was wondering where you were heading off to",
                    "file": ["18.png"],
                    "source": "https://x.com/joetherobo52693/status/2056878449889824842",
                    "unix": 1779233012
                },
                {
                    "from": "Vastina",
                    "text": "I'm Thinking I Can Find Something In The Bathroom That Could Help Waltz!",
                    "file": ["19.png"],
                    "source": "https://x.com/VistaWidgets/status/2056874445977813491",
                    "unix": 1779233463
                },
                {
                    "from": "Joe",
                    "text": "\u00F0\u009F\u009F\u00A7: oh\nwell i don't think you'll find anything useful in there\nbut you do you i guess",
                    "file": ["20.png"],
                    "source": "https://x.com/joetherobo52693/status/2056882280233087141",
                    "unix": 1779233925

                },
                {
                    "from": "Vastina",
                    "text": "*Rummaging* Let Me See Here... Hmm Hmm Hmm...",
                    "file": ["21.png"],
                    "source": "https://x.com/VistaWidgets/status/2056892432940204172",
                    "unix": 1779236345

                },
                {
                    "from": "Joe",
                    "text": "\u00F0\u009F\u009F\u00A7: hrm....",
                    "file": ["22.png"],
                    "source": "https://x.com/joetherobo52693/status/2056895133581263094",
                    "unix": 1779236989

                },
                {
                    "from": "Vastina",
                    "text": "Ah-hah! Perfect! This Will Work!",
                    "file": ["23.png"],
                    "source": "https://x.com/VistaWidgets/status/2056903861118308638",
                    "unix": 1779239070

                },
                {
                    "from": "Joe",
                    "text": "\u00F0\u009F\u009F\u00A7: WHAT THE FUCK DID YOU FIND",
                    "file": ["24.png"],
                    "source": "https://x.com/joetherobo52693/status/2056905102808560071",
                    "unix": 1779239366

                },
                {
                    "from": "Vastina",
                    "text": "STRING CHEESE!",
                    "file": ["25.png"],
                    "source": "https://x.com/VistaWidgets/status/2056906353130545229",
                    "unix": 1779239664

                },
                {
                    "from": "Joe",
                    "text": "\u00F0\u009F\u009F\u00A7: HOW THE FUCK IS STRING CHEESE GONNA HELP",
                    "file": ["26.png"],
                    "source": "https://x.com/joetherobo52693/status/2056906815418282495",
                    "unix": 1779239774
                },
                {
                    "from": "Vastina",
                    "text": "JUST TRUST ME!",
                    "file": [],
                    "source": "https://x.com/VistaWidgets/status/2056907283649441850",
                    "unix": 1779239766
                },
                {
                    "from": "Joe",
                    "text": "\u00F0\u009F\u009F\u00A7: OKAY THEN\nIT BETTER WORK!!!",
                    "file": [],
                    "source": "https://x.com/joetherobo52693/status/2056907889034318055",
                    "unix": 1779240030
                },
                {
                    "from": "Vastina",
                    "text": "Alright Waltz, I Have A Plan! This Might Hurt A Bit. ;D",
                    "file": ["27.png"],
                    "source": "https://x.com/VistaWidgets/status/2056919574742749480",
                    "unix": 1779242816
                },
                {
                    "from": "Waltz",
                    "text": "\u00F0\u009F\u009F\u00A2: I AM SCARED",
                    "file": [],
                    "source": "https://x.com/joetherobo52693/status/2056919685229142248",
                    "unix": 1779242843
                },
                {
                    "from": "Vastina",
                    "text": "(Your computer is unable to process the immense and overwhelming power of string cheese at this time.\n\n The renmoval of Waltz from the ceiling will be over in just a moment.\nThank you.",
                    "file": ["28.png"],
                    "source": "https://x.com/VistaWidgets/status/2056919961730175364",
                    "unix": 1779242909
                },
                {
                    "from": "Waltz",
                    "text": "\u00F0\u009F\u009F\u00A2: OUCHHH\nWAIT",
                    "file": [],
                    "source": "https://x.com/joetherobo52693/status/2057119110090170397",
                    "unix": 1779290389
                },
                {
                    "from": "Waltz",
                    "text": "\u00F0\u009F\u009F\u00A2: IT APPEARS I HAVE GOTTEN UNSTUCK",
                    "file": [],
                    "source": "https://x.com/joetherobo52693/status/2057119908375249034",
                    "unix": 1779290580
                },
                {
                    "from": "Waltz",
                    "text": "\u00F0\u009F\u009F\u00A2: YAYYYYYYYY",
                    "file": [],
                    "source": "https://x.com/joetherobo52693/status/2057120373418680342",
                    "unix": 1779290691
                },
                {
                    "from": "Vastina",
                    "text": "Man... My Head... What Happened?",
                    "file": [],
                    "source": "https://x.com/VistaWidgets/status/2057130043365642523",
                    "unix": 1779292996
                },
                {
                    "from": "Joe",
                    "text": "\u00F0\u009F\u009F\u00A7: i think we got Waltz off the ceiling",
                    "file": ["32.png"],
                    "source": "https://x.com/joetherobo52693/status/2057135040920703486",
                    "unix": 1779294188
                },
                {
                    "from": "Joe",
                    "text": "\u00F0\u009F\u009F\u00A7: also i think he already left",
                    "file": ["33.png"],
                    "source": "https://x.com/joetherobo52693/status/2057137694245818565",
                    "unix": 1779294820
                },
                {
                    "from": "Vastina",
                    "text": "Here- *Grunt* Let Me Help You Up.",
                    "file": ["34.png"],
                    "source": "https://x.com/VistaWidgets/status/2057165248537174044",
                    "unix": 1779301390
                },
                {
                    "from": "Joe",
                    "text": "\u00F0\u009F\u009F\u00A7: Thanks Vastina",
                    "file": [],
                    "source": "https://x.com/joetherobo52693/status/2057166203932614749",
                    "unix": 1779301617
                },
                {
                    "from": "Joe",
                    "text": "\u00F0\u009F\u009F\u00A7: so uh\nnow what",
                    "file": ["35.png"],
                    "source": "https://x.com/joetherobo52693/status/2057169663629353451",
                    "unix": 1779302442
                },
                {
                    "from": "Vastina",
                    "text": "Maybe I Can Spend Some Time With Vivian?",
                    "file": [],
                    "source": "https://x.com/VistaWidgets/status/2057170436346044687",
                    "unix": 1779302627
                },
                {
                    "from": "Joe",
                    "text": "\u00F0\u009F\u009F\u00A7: shore\ni'm sure she won't mind",
                    "file": ["36.png"],
                    "source": "https://x.com/joetherobo52693/status/2057173899939344686",
                    "unix": 1779303452
                },
                {
                    "from": "Joe",
                    "text": "\u00F0\u009F\u009F\u00A7: anyways you two do whatever\ni got other things to do",
                    "file": ["37.png"],
                    "source": "https://x.com/joetherobo52693/status/2057183782571065409",
                    "unix": 1779305809
                },
                {
                    "from": "Vastina",
                    "text": "Hey, Viv! You Doin Alright?",
                    "file": ["38.png"],
                    "source": "https://x.com/VistaWidgets/status/2057184487931302108",
                    "unix": 1779305977
                },
                {
                    "from": "Vivian",
                    "text": "\u00F0\u009F\u0092\u009C: yeeeep\ni'm doin' fine",
                    "file": ["39.png"],
                    "source": "https://x.com/joetherobo52693/status/2057186917830082820",
                    "unix": 1779306556
                },
                {
                    "from": "Vastina",
                    "text": "Well, That's Good! Need Help Getting Up?",
                    "file": [],
                    "source": "https://x.com/VistaWidgets/status/2057187879474921727",
                    "unix": 1779306785
                },
                {
                    "from": "Vivian",
                    "text": "\u00F0\u009F\u0092\u009C: nah nah i got it",
                    "file": [],
                    "source": "https://x.com/joetherobo52693/status/2057188225517531448",
                    "unix": 1779306868
                },
                {
                    "from": "Vivian",
                    "text": "\u00F0\u009F\u0092\u009C: so uh\nwhat do you want to do",
                    "file": ["40.png"],
                    "source": "https://x.com/joetherobo52693/status/2057215619712389347",
                    "unix": 1779313399
                },
                {
                    "from": "Vastina",
                    "text": "I Guess Just Hang Out, Do Stuff Together?",
                    "file": [],
                    "source": "https://x.com/VistaWidgets/status/2057218020267712900",
                    "unix": 17793139710
                },
                {
                    "from": "Vivian",
                    "text": "\u00F0\u009F\u0092\u009C: like what exactly",
                    "file": [],
                    "source": "https://x.com/joetherobo52693/status/2057218307237781973",
                    "unix": 1779314040
                },
                {
                    "from": "Vastina",
                    "text": "Do You Guys Have UNO?",
                    "file": [],
                    "source": "https://x.com/VistaWidgets/status/2057222725622472940",
                    "unix": 1779315093
                },
                {
                    "from": "Vivian",
                    "text": "\u00F0\u009F\u0092\u009C: nope",
                    "file": [],
                    "source": "https://x.com/joetherobo52693/status/2057224286310400050",
                    "unix": 1779315465
                },
                {
                    "from": "Vastina",
                    "text": "What Do You Guys Do In Your Pastime???",
                    "file": [],
                    "source": "https://x.com/VistaWidgets/status/2057226943087378609",
                    "unix": 1779316099
                },
                {
                    "from": "Vivian",
                    "text": "\u00F0\u009F\u0092\u009C: nothing really\nthere ain't much to do around here",
                    "file": [],
                    "source": "https://x.com/joetherobo52693/status/2057227796204703858",
                    "unix": 1779316302
                },
                {
                    "from": "Vastina",
                    "text": "...",
                    "file": [],
                    "source": "https://x.com/VistaWidgets/status/2057227985569071363",
                    "unix": 1779316347
                },
                {
                    "from": "Vivian",
                    "text": "\u00F0\u009F\u0092\u009C: ...",
                    "file": ["41.png", "42.png"],
                    "source": "https://x.com/joetherobo52693/status/2057229435900707204",
                    "unix": 1779316693
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}